{
  "component": "p12",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "\"WE'VE GOT HIM RIGHT WHERE WE WANT HIM.\" I HEARD\nTHAT.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THERE WAS MORE AFTER IT.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A REMARKABLE HOUSE. EVERY SENTENCE NEEDS AN\nALIBI.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE DECORATIVE BACKS. VIVIAN HAS DRESSED THE\nINSTRUCTIONS BETTER THAN ME. THERE'S A ROTATION\nDIAGRAM ON THE RAIL.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "RELEASE CATCH ON AUDIENCE SIDE, THEN ROTATE.",
      "record_id": "P12.READ.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 7,
      "header_entry": 6,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THE WALL ENDS THERE. THE SEATS KEEP GOING. I CAN\nWALK ROUND AND SEE THE OTHER SIDE OF THE RAIL.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "A SAFE LITTLE CLICK AND NO MOVEMENT. THE DIAGRAM\nSAYS THE RELEASE IS ON THE AUDIENCE SIDE.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "OH, YOU'VE BEEN ABLE TO READ THEM ALL ALONG. I\nHOPE THE PEOPLE AT THE BACK APPRECIATED MY\nCONFIDENT NODDING.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WHAT DO THE CARDS SAY, FROM LEFT TO RIGHT?",
      "record_id": "P12.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 11,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "THERE'S THE RELEASE CATCH. REACHABLE FROM THE\nSEATS, OUT OF REACH FROM THE COURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "CATCH RELEASED, AND IT STAYS OPEN. GOOD. I'VE\nFINISHED EMPLOYING PEOPLE AS HINGES.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "BACK TO THE COURTYARD. I CAN TURN THE RACK NOW.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WORDS FACING ME. NOW I CAN STOP TRYING TO READ\nTHROUGH THEM.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, SHOW, TOAST. FOOD, RITA'S WORK, THEN\nPROMISES. THAT'S THE ORDER ON THE BOARD.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THE MICROPHONE LEAD NEEDS THE MATCHING THREE-DOT\nMIC SOCKET. WE'VE ALREADY REHEARSED THE DIFFICULT\nPART.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "STILL ON TAPE. SELECT MIC. I'M READY TO HEAR A\nVOICE THAT STOPS WHEN I DO.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WELCOME TO THE LAUNCH OF ALL OUR NEW PARTNERSHIPS.",
      "record_id": "P12.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'VE PROMOTED ME WHILE I'M STANDING HERE.\nTONIGHT'S A TRIAL. FUTURE WORK NEEDS ANOTHER\nCONVERSATION. PUT THAT PART BACK.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE HERE IS GETTING A NEW PARTNER TONIGHT.",
      "record_id": "P12.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A MEAL AND A COLLABORATION TRIAL. NOBODY WAS\nPROMISED A DATE OR A JOB. YOU CAN'T HAND PEOPLE\nOUT BETWEEN COURSES, JACKIE.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.005",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "A MEAL, A TRIAL, AND THE WHOLE TRUTH THIS TIME.",
      "record_id": "P12.CHOICE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 26,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WELCOME. TONIGHT IS A MEAL FOR EIGHT AND A TRIAL\nOF WHAT WE CAN DO TOGETHER.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "BUNNY BROUGHT THE GUESTS. FRANKIE TURNED MY\nNODDING INTO A PLAN. I COOKED.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO SUPPLIED THE SOUND AND WILL GREET US. VIVIAN\nDID THE STYLING. RITA MADE THE CERAMIC SERVICE AND\nHAS HER OWN WORK TO PRESENT.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX REPAIRED AND TESTED THE GATE. MR. STRINGER\nIS JOINING US TO DISCUSS RENEWAL AND THE PROMISED\nREPAIR.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WE CAN TALK ABOUT FUTURE COLLABORATIONS. TONIGHT\nPROMISES NOBODY A DATE OR A NEW JOB.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "AND WE'VE GOT HIM RIGHT WHERE WE WANT HIM: IN THE\nFRONT ROW FOR RITA'S WORK.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU COULD HAVE LED WITH \"FRONT ROW.\"",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN YOU'D HAVE FOUND SOMETHING HEAVY TO DO AT THE\nBACK.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "MAY I TRY THE WELCOME ON YOU FIRST?",
      "record_id": "P12.CHOICE.005",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WE UNDERSTOOD THE MEAL, THE TRIAL, AND WHAT ISN'T\nPROMISED. SAY IT TO THEM.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 12,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "AND NOW, A LITTLE ATMOSPHERE.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'VE GOT ATMOSPHERE IN MY BRA.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 40,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'RE ALL WEARING IT. INCLUDING YOU, MILO.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "FULL AUDIENCE PARTICIPATION.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "HOLD STILL. YOU'VE GOT \"QUIET HOUSEHOLD\" IN YOUR\nHAIR.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "CLEAR THE WORKING SURFACE, THEN FETCH OUR THINGS.\nSUPPER STILL HAS TO GET THROUGH THE DOORS.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 44,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL BE AT THE KITCHEN WITH THE POT.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "MY PANEL IS STILL COVERED ON THE SIDE-PASSAGE\nCART.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL GREET FROM THE FRONT. DO STOP ME IF I START\nTEARING ANYTHING UP.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "TRY THE VIEW FROM THE SEATS. THE RACK HAS A\nPHYSICAL RELEASE ON ITS FAR SIDE.",
      "record_id": "P12.HINT.1",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "WALK BEYOND THE SET EDGE. READ THE FACES YOURSELF\nOR ASK THE AUDIENCE, THEN FIND THE SWIVEL-RELEASE\nCATCH.",
      "record_id": "P12.HINT.2",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "FROM THE AUDIENCE SIDE, READ THE CARDS AND PULL\nTHE RELEASE. RETURN TO THE COURTYARD, ROTATE THE\nRACK TOWARD YOU, AND RESTORE SERVE, SHOW, TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P12.HINT.3",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "USE THE WORKING MICROPHONE AND CHOOSE THE COMPLETE\nTRUTHFUL INTRODUCTION.",
      "record_id": "P12.HINT.3",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 49,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "COMPLETE ONE CONTEST ATTEMPT WITH FELIX BEFORE THE\nFINAL PUBLIC INTRODUCTION. YOU CAN STILL INSPECT\nTHE CLUES AND REHEARSE.",
      "record_id": "VC03.NEED_RESOLUTION",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 54,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "\"WE'VE GOT HIM RIGHT WHERE WE WANT HIM.\" I HEARD\nTHAT.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THERE WAS MORE AFTER IT.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S A REMARKABLE HOUSE. EVERY SENTENCE NEEDS AN\nALIBI.",
      "record_id": "P12.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 4,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE DECORATIVE BACKS. VIVIAN HAS DRESSED THE\nINSTRUCTIONS BETTER THAN ME. THERE'S A ROTATION\nDIAGRAM ON THE RAIL.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THE WALL ENDS THERE. THE SEATS KEEP GOING. I CAN\nWALK ROUND AND SEE THE OTHER SIDE OF THE RAIL.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "A SAFE LITTLE CLICK AND NO MOVEMENT. THE DIAGRAM\nSAYS THE RELEASE IS ON THE AUDIENCE SIDE.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "OH, YOU'VE BEEN ABLE TO READ THEM ALL ALONG. I\nHOPE THE PEOPLE AT THE BACK APPRECIATED MY\nCONFIDENT NODDING.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THERE'S THE RELEASE CATCH. REACHABLE FROM THE\nSEATS, OUT OF REACH FROM THE COURTYARD.",
      "record_id": "P12.LOOK.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "CATCH RELEASED, AND IT STAYS OPEN. GOOD. I'VE\nFINISHED EMPLOYING PEOPLE AS HINGES.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "BACK TO THE COURTYARD. I CAN TURN THE RACK NOW.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WORDS FACING ME. NOW I CAN STOP TRYING TO READ\nTHROUGH THEM.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, SHOW, TOAST. FOOD, RITA'S WORK, THEN\nPROMISES. THAT'S THE ORDER ON THE BOARD.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THE MICROPHONE LEAD NEEDS THE MATCHING THREE-DOT\nMIC SOCKET. WE'VE ALREADY REHEARSED THE DIFFICULT\nPART.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "STILL ON TAPE. SELECT MIC. I'M READY TO HEAR A\nVOICE THAT STOPS WHEN I DO.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'VE PROMOTED ME WHILE I'M STANDING HERE.\nTONIGHT'S A TRIAL. FUTURE WORK NEEDS ANOTHER\nCONVERSATION. PUT THAT PART BACK.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "A MEAL AND A COLLABORATION TRIAL. NOBODY WAS\nPROMISED A DATE OR A JOB. YOU CAN'T HAND PEOPLE\nOUT BETWEEN COURSES, JACKIE.",
      "record_id": "P12.FAILURE.005",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WELCOME. TONIGHT IS A MEAL FOR EIGHT AND A TRIAL\nOF WHAT WE CAN DO TOGETHER.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "BUNNY BROUGHT THE GUESTS. FRANKIE TURNED MY\nNODDING INTO A PLAN. I COOKED.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO SUPPLIED THE SOUND AND WILL GREET US. VIVIAN\nDID THE STYLING. RITA MADE THE CERAMIC SERVICE AND\nHAS HER OWN WORK TO PRESENT.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX REPAIRED AND TESTED THE GATE. MR. STRINGER\nIS JOINING US TO DISCUSS RENEWAL AND THE PROMISED\nREPAIR.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WE CAN TALK ABOUT FUTURE COLLABORATIONS. TONIGHT\nPROMISES NOBODY A DATE OR A NEW JOB.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "AND WE'VE GOT HIM RIGHT WHERE WE WANT HIM: IN THE\nFRONT ROW FOR RITA'S WORK.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU COULD HAVE LED WITH \"FRONT ROW.\"",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN YOU'D HAVE FOUND SOMETHING HEAVY TO DO AT THE\nBACK.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WE UNDERSTOOD THE MEAL, THE TRIAL, AND WHAT ISN'T\nPROMISED. SAY IT TO THEM.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 12,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "AND NOW, A LITTLE ATMOSPHERE.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'VE GOT ATMOSPHERE IN MY BRA.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 40,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "WE'RE ALL WEARING IT. INCLUDING YOU, MILO.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "FULL AUDIENCE PARTICIPATION.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "HOLD STILL. YOU'VE GOT \"QUIET HOUSEHOLD\" IN YOUR\nHAIR.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "CLEAR THE WORKING SURFACE, THEN FETCH OUR THINGS.\nSUPPER STILL HAS TO GET THROUGH THE DOORS.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 44,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL BE AT THE KITCHEN WITH THE POT.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 24,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "MY PANEL IS STILL COVERED ON THE SIDE-PASSAGE\nCART.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL GREET FROM THE FRONT. DO STOP ME IF I START\nTEARING ANYTHING UP.",
      "record_id": "P12.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 48,
      "header_entry": 38,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, SHOW, TOAST. THAT'S WHAT WE CAN SEE. WE\nASSUMED WHOEVER PUT THEM THERE HAD A REASON.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 12,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 41,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE, TOAST, SHOW. THAT'S WHAT WE CAN SEE. WE\nASSUMED WHOEVER PUT THEM THERE HAD A REASON.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 12,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 42,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW, SERVE, TOAST. THAT'S WHAT WE CAN SEE. WE\nASSUMED WHOEVER PUT THEM THERE HAD A REASON.",
      "record_id": "P12.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 213,
      "entry": 58,
      "header_entry": 12,
      "speaker_id": "audience",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 43,
      "audio_module": 924
    },
    {
